{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C3\", \"C2\", \"C5\", \"C1\", \"C4\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C3\", \"C2\", \"C5\", \"C4\", \"C1\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C3\", \"C5\", \"C1\", \"C4\", \"C2\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\", \"C5\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C5\", \"C2\", \"C4\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"总排序优先考虑是否保住关键心理因果、是否解释了紧张未解却仍然前进；C3最完整地连起两种珍惜、两难的代价和带怕行动，C2的因果推进清楚但恐惧不够显明，C5则更贴近前段对过度用力的担忧。keep：C3 > C2 > C5 > C4 > C1，因为C3明确保留了行动带来的力量、旧愿带来的安慰、两者难免相伤、争取与不争取各有风险，以及不必等到无所畏惧才行动；C2补足了从无力中重新动起来和不能无限等待，但没有充分保住带着恐惧行动这一点。cover：C3 > C5 > C1 > C4 > C2，因为C3最能解释为什么争取会威胁安宁、不争取又无法保护珍惜之物，且恐惧仍在却已开始行动；C5和C1也写出了这种行动中的犹疑，而C2的结尾更像作出决定，较少解释珠子里的持续紧张。lean：C2 > C1 > C3 > C4 > C5，因为C2各步分工清楚，从行动的作用推进到怀念的局限、代价和行动决定；C1压缩得紧凑，C3和C4略有重复说明两边难以兼顾，C5则连续写到两边受损、硬撑和害怕失去安宁。plain：C1 > C5 > C2 > C4 > C3，因为再逼自己一把也没用和一争取就可能硬撑都像具体的自我经验；C2的说法也较自然，而难处不在自己不够坚定、两全办法等表述更像对处境的归纳总结。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cd2ae377-1103-4b5a-af64-a1864cc44415", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T220440001148Z", "elapsed_seconds": 144.781, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:07:04.799194+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "64113e30674f2eca22e25291849c412cadc23fdf99649ddb427c70e9ac2da03b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T220440001148Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b0a6ff9eb6d973609e397dcbbbf916b7bb6b0be747fd824f6e911881f39c6f38"}}}
